    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DX Legends is a fast-paced online battle arena where players fight to <strong>rescue the princess, </strong>as do their rivals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against rivals in action-packed modes like Save the Princess, a thrilling twist on capture-the-flag, or Legends Mode, a condensed adventure in which you have  limited time to save the kingdom. Want pure mayhem? Jump into Deathmatch and unleash destruction! With deep character customization and unpredictable battles, DX Legends is the perfect playground for fast-paced fun! Will you rise as a legend or fall in the fray?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple kingdoms &amp; maps to explore and conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse battle modes for all kinds of players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique items &amp; abilities to create your perfect playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-play multiplayer (PC, Mac, Linux &amp; Mobile)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op mode for a more relaxed adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization: create, share, and download Legends!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the Princess</strong> \u2013 Battle solo or in teams to rescue the princess before your rivals do!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathmatch (Solo &amp; Team)</strong> \u2013 Pure, unfiltered chaos. No objectives, just destruction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legends Mode</strong> \u2013 Conquer zones, collect golden pieces, and defeat the Dark Lord.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Raider</strong> \u2013 ??? (New game mode in development!)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Legend!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of legendary heroes or create your own using the in-game editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload your unique characters and download Legends from players worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character, your rules, your legend.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DX Legends is a fast-paced online battle arena where players fight to <strong>rescue the princess, </strong>as do their rivals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against rivals in action-packed modes like Save the Princess, a thrilling twist on capture-the-flag, or Legends Mode, a condensed adventure in which you have  limited time to save the kingdom. Want pure mayhem? Jump into Deathmatch and unleash destruction! With deep character customization and unpredictable battles, DX Legends is the perfect playground for fast-paced fun! Will you rise as a legend or fall in the fray?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple kingdoms &amp; maps to explore and conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse battle modes for all kinds of players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique items &amp; abilities to create your perfect playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-play multiplayer (PC, Mac, Linux &amp; Mobile)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op mode for a more relaxed adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization: create, share, and download Legends!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the Princess</strong> \u2013 Battle solo or in teams to rescue the princess before your rivals do!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathmatch (Solo &amp; Team)</strong> \u2013 Pure, unfiltered chaos. No objectives, just destruction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legends Mode</strong> \u2013 Conquer zones, collect golden pieces, and defeat the Dark Lord.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Raider</strong> \u2013 ??? (New game mode in development!)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Legend!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of legendary heroes or create your own using the in-game editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload your unique characters and download Legends from players worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character, your rules, your legend.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
